4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vBq5dI02Hl0Q7kNvwFAvSlr&_nc_oc=AdpG86ww6g3RcP4-KpfNPX2-6IpiNUgQrmjF4WnMSIdI0bWNzhCkvbeUBog58d7dPUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLye7yxdwAuvK5vGh9NfXyiRc45lktgJ0Ldsi_C2oTnHA&oe=6ABE5A54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LcRFTPrU-A8Q7kNvwGofnf6&_nc_oc=AdqMkPKmCpGx0PeYYZ7PvPcvSE-1u1y9-hPabbA92vXqoDDvupZh1VZZCxMw7pvfUyc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJAdVRVRV3gPQAkLIcbp9CVYhh5CKreaPjHJj_-CULzhA&oe=6ABE5F32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S_odqVOdpI4Q7kNvwGOBrbc&_nc_oc=Adp2dy6pH8WrdcBvYrEWobQjl2FQuG1EOIH4vJr13iBBQfGhH8nQX-BKBswhLHbtf4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJxWubBoAH2h2GX6sXcs_um9tqEI0aGew35iWCzREx8Hg&oe=6ABE6CD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p